OL,3,GNEWSAPolice hunt for three men after
OL,4,AHalloween stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are searching for three men
OL,7,Fafter a man was left with life-changing
OL,8,Finjuries in a stabbing.
OL,10,FWiltshire Police said the attack
OL,11,Fhappened near the car park at Tesco
OL,12,FExtra in Trowbridge shortly before
OL,13,F14:00 GMT on 31 October.
OL,15,FThe victim, a man in his 20s, was taken
OL,16,Fto hospital with potentially
OL,17,Flife-changing injuries, police said.
OL,19,FThe force has launched an appeal for
OL,20,Fwitnesses and footage relating to the
OL,21,Fattack, and added the suspects fled the
OL,22,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
